@baseUrl = http://localhost:18081

### 使用独立测试知识库；先登录并创建kbId，替换为你明确要操作的资料。
### 一键上传并后台入库（会调用Embedding；切分参数可省略）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents/ingest?chunkSize=800&overlap=120
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=LifecycleBoundary

--LifecycleBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="knowledge-demo.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../examples/knowledge-demo.md
--LifecycleBoundary--

> {% if (response.status === 202 || response.status === 200) { client.global.set("taskId", response.body.taskId); client.global.set("docId", response.body.documentId); } %}

### 已上传文档一键入库；async=false可同步等待，响应中的status仍须检查
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents/{{docId}}/ingest?async=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"chunkSize":800,"overlap":120}

### 当前知识库各文档的最近任务（最多100项）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/ingestion-tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 任务阶段、错误码、错误原因和重试次数
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/ingestion-tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 只重试失败任务，保留任务ID并增加attempt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/ingestion-tasks/{{taskId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 当前默认切分/检索参数
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/search/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 仅检索预览；本次Top-K和阈值不改变聊天默认配置，会调用Embedding
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"这份资料讲什么？","topK":4,"minScore":0.35}

### 历史分页；beforeId取上次响应nextBeforeId，省略则读取最新一页
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages/page?size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### streamId从本次SSE的start事件获取；cancelled=false时按status/历史确认是否已保存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/streams/{{streamId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 删除本次测试文档及其片段/向量/任务；原文件清理状态在响应中
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents/{{docId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 删除本次测试知识库内全部资料，旧聊天与来源快照保留
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 删除本次测试会话与全部消息，不能用旧编号重新创建
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
